# Copied verbatim into dist/, where Cloudflare reads it.
#
# dist/ is both the static-asset directory and the place Astro writes the
# server bundle, so without this wrangler refuses to deploy: it will not upload
# a _worker.js directory as a public asset, and it is right not to -- that is
# server-side code, and it would be served to anyone who asked for it.
#
# _routes.json is Cloudflare's own routing manifest and is likewise not a page.
_worker.js
_routes.json
